        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Supermaze, you can navigate mazes as a mouse. Try not to waste time, because each level starts with only 2 minutes to complete each one, but don't be too quick, because mazes usually have plenty of hazards that can harm you if you don't time your movements properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main objective is very simple. Don't die, don't run out of time, and GET THE CHEESE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated mazes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite runner</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D with a top-down perspective</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively difficult</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 unlockable characters (not including default)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character stats and special abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unlockable color-based maze themes (also not including default)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique items that can assist the player</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >34 different types of hazards and obstacles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-based scoring system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple stylized hand-drawn graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer robots with friggin' lasers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A main menu and a pause menu (yes really)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never-ending fun (and rage)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese in every level</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Supermaze, you can navigate mazes as a mouse. Try not to waste time, because each level starts with only 2 minutes to complete each one, but don't be too quick, because mazes usually have plenty of hazards that can harm you if you don't time your movements properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main objective is very simple. Don't die, don't run out of time, and GET THE CHEESE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated mazes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite runner</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D with a top-down perspective</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively difficult</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 unlockable characters (not including default)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique character stats and special abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unlockable color-based maze themes (also not including default)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique items that can assist the player</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >34 different types of hazards and obstacles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-based scoring system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple stylized hand-drawn graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer robots with friggin' lasers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A main menu and a pause menu (yes really)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never-ending fun (and rage)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese in every level</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A maze game with progressive difficulty, and an endless amount of randomly generated levels.",
